# Frontend Vue

- Vue 3 `<script setup>` + TypeScript; Pinia; vue-router; `openapi-fetch`.
- Call the API through `frontend/src/api/index.ts`. Types come from `schema.ts` — regenerate with `./do update-api-schema`.
- Course context comes from the router (`/class/:id`) and props into pages/modals — do not hardcode course UUIDs.
- Prefer `v-model` / refs over `document.getElementById` when editing forms.
- `npm run type-check` (`vue-tsc`) must stay green; it is part of quality gates.
